- A camera becoming unreachable or reporting stale health status.
- An HVR or edge device becoming unavailable during recorded-video retrieval.
- Slow downstream services causing thread-pool or connection-pool exhaustion.
- Concurrent requests causing database race conditions.
- Firmware update failures across large fleets of devices.
- Video-retention reports showing incorrect or incomplete information.
- Permission changes not propagating consistently across application instances.
- Kafka events being lost, delayed, or delivered more than once.
- Redis cache stampedes or stale cached data.
- Failures during cloud deployments or Kubernetes migrations.
- Problems with retries, timeouts, circuit breakers, idempotency, and eventual consistency.

